# Task skill + MCP gate (100% correct before Done)

> **Lean path:** [`mdeai-workflow.mdc`](./mdeai-workflow.mdc) — ≤3 skills, lite pre-flight for C/U. Full gate below for **P0 launch**.

Parent: [`mdeai-proof-driven-delivery.mdc`](./mdeai-proof-driven-delivery.mdc) · [`mdeai-skills-best-practices.mdc`](./mdeai-skills-best-practices.mdc)  
**Index:** [`mdeapp/index-skills.md`](../index-skills.md) · **Per-task matrix:** [`mdeapp/todo.md`](../todo.md) § Skill + MCP gate  
**Scan root:** `mdeapp/.claude/skills/` (symlinks → `.agents/skills/`)

## Agent contract (every task, every session)

**Do not mark a task Done, merge-ready, or "100% correct" without all three:**

1. **Skills loaded** — read `SKILL.md` for each skill in the task's todo row (≤5 total)
2. **MCP verified** — call matching MCP before external API claims or AC sign-off
3. **`task-verifier` pass** — disk + tests + runtime + prod proof; Evidence Score ≥ **90** for P0 `phase:launch`

## Mandatory workflow (in order)

| Step | Action | Artifact |
|------|--------|----------|
| **0 Pre-flight** | Linear MCP `get_issue` + spec on disk + route skills/MCP from todo row | `tasks/testing/evidence/YYYY-MM-DD/SAN-###-PREFLIGHT.md` |
| **1 Implement** | Only after pre-flight **PROCEED** | — |
| **2 Test** | L1 Vitest + L2 Playwright (if UI/agent) | evidence file |
| **3 Real-world** | Browser / Playwright / Chrome DevTools on localhost + prod | screenshot path in evidence |
| **4 PR review** | cubic + CodeRabbit when PR exists | review table in evidence |
| **5 Completion gate** | Re-run `task-verifier` checklist; score all 5 Evidence dimensions | update `mdeapp/changelog.md` + `mdeapp/todo.md` |
| **6 Linear** | In Review with evidence link; **Done** only after user OK | — |

## 100% correct definition (P0 launch tasks)

A task is **100% correct** only when **all** pass:

| Gate | Requirement |
|------|-------------|
| Spec | Linear AC + disk spec match; pre-flight **PROCEED** |
| Skills | Every skill in todo row **read** (`SKILL.md`); logged in pre-flight |
| MCP | Every MCP in todo row **called**; contradictions fixed before code |
| Tests | Targeted Vitest green; Playwright if persona-visible |
| Runtime | `npm run dev` clean + route/API 200 |
| Production | Prod SHA = merge commit; curl + L4 browser for P0 |
| Process | Full Linear title; changelog + todo synced; ledger + persona updated |
| Score | Evidence Score ≥ **90** (Grade **A**) |

**< 90% = not Done** — status stays **In Review** or **In Progress**.

## Skill routing (authoritative rows)

Use the **per-task table** in [`mdeapp/todo.md`](../todo.md) § **Skill + MCP gate**.  
Fallback router: [`index-skills.md`](../index-skills.md) § Load by work type.

**Always load (every task):** `mde-task-lifecycle` → `task-verifier`  
**Cap:** ≤5 skills total including domain pack.

## MCP matrix (call before coding)

| Touch surface | MCP server | Tool examples |
|---------------|------------|---------------|
| Linear issue truth | `plugin-linear-linear` | `get_issue` |
| Gemini models | `user-gemini-api-docs-mcp` | `search_docs` |
| CopilotKit / AG-UI | CopilotKit MCP | `search-docs`, `search-ag-ui-docs` |
| Mastra | `user-mastra` | `searchMastraDocs` |
| Supabase schema / RLS | `plugin-supabase-supabase` | `execute_sql`, `list_tables` |
| Maps / Places | `user-google-maps-code-assist` | `retrieve-instructions`, docs |

If MCP is down → matching skill + vendored example; log **MCP unavailable** in pre-flight.

