## Sync obligations (after every task)

Update **before** claiming complete:

- [`mdeapp/todo.md`](../todo.md) — skill/MCP checkboxes + grades
- [`mdeapp/changelog.md`](../changelog.md) — append entry
- [`tasks/testing/evidence/TASK-LEDGER.md`](../../../tasks/testing/evidence/TASK-LEDGER.md)
- Persona file under `tasks/testing/personas/`
- [`tasks/dashboard/project-health.md`](../../../tasks/dashboard/project-health.md) on batch changes

## Anti-patterns (reject)

- ❌ Completing a task without reading routed `SKILL.md` files
- ❌ Claiming AC met without MCP verification on external APIs
- ❌ Done / 100% with Evidence Score < 90 on P0
- ❌ Skipping `task-verifier` because tests passed
- ❌ todo/changelog not synced at end of turn
- ❌ Using shorthand `SAN-545` without full Linear title in evidence — see [`mdeai-task-naming.mdc`](./mdeai-task-naming.mdc) (always apply)
